  "title": "IRADIMED CORPORATION Announces FDA 510(k) Clearance for MRidium® 3870 Infusion Pump System",
  "summary": "Iradimed Corporation (NASDAQ: IRMD), a global leader in innovative medical devices for MRI environments, today announced that the U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA) has granted 510(k) clearance for its next-generation MRidium® 3870 IV Infusion Pump System.",
